%% ID: S04 | Title: 點候選卡 → handoff_ready | Last updated 2026-05-25
%% User action：BU 在工作區點候選卡片
%% 對應 backend：select_candidate (session_service.py:897)
%% 規則：候選清單已存在 + 還沒進 handoff → 自動觸發 emit_dual_output（不必走完 stage 5）
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor BU
    participant FE as Frontend<br/>(CandidateCards + page.tsx)
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant SVC as session_service.py
    participant G as Graph
    participant LLM
    participant Bus as SSE Bus

    BU->>FE: 點候選卡 #N
    FE->>FE: setSelectedRankN<br/>setGeneratingHandofftrue
    FE->>API: POST /sessions/{id}/candidates/select {rank: N}
    API->>SVC: select_candidatedb, session, rank<br/>session_service.py:897
    SVC->>G: aupdate_state {selected_candidate: N}
    SVC->>G: aget_state
    G-->>SVC: state

    alt scored_candidates 非空 + 還沒 ready_to_handoff
        SVC->>G: aupdate_state {ready_to_handoff: True}
        SVC->>G: ainvoke{} 觸發 emit_dual_output
        G->>G: entry_router 看 ready_to_handoff=True<br/>→ emit_dual_output（nodes.py:551）
        G->>G: 組 structured JSON<br/>(含 ai_necessity_triage:<br/>selected_solution_class /<br/>selected_ai_necessity /<br/>selected_rationale /<br/>bu_overrode)
        G->>LLM: emit_paragraph.j2 chat_stream<br/>產 200-400 字 paragraph
        LLM-->>G: paragraph
        G->>Bus: publish handoff_ready<br/>{paragraph, structured}
    else 候選清單還沒形成
        Note over SVC: 不觸發 handoff,<br/>只記錄 selected_candidate
    end

    SVC-->>API: GraphState
    API-->>FE: 202 AcceptedResponse
    Bus-->>FE: SSE handoff_ready
    FE->>FE: setHandoff{paragraph}<br/>setGeneratingHandofffalse
    Note over FE: HandoffConfirmModal 顯示<br/>BU 看到 200-400 字段落描述<br/>（後續見 S07）
